# Required for signed, temporary download URLs and the in-memory video limiter.
# Generate locally using: openssl rand -hex 32
# Configure only in the Vercel project Environment Variables (never expose in frontend).
DOWNLOAD_SECRET=

# No database, external quota API or additional keys needed.
# The 4-video / rolling 24-hour quota is BEST-EFFORT per warm Node process.
# A serverless restart or request routed to another instance resets/changes the quota.
